[ti:America the Beautiful]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]O beautiful for spacious skies
[00:28.16]For amber waves of grain
[00:46.64]For purple mountain majesties
[01:10.24]Above the fruited plain
[01:22.40]America, America
[01:35.44]God shed His grace on thee
[01:48.24]And crown thy good with brotherhood
[02:18.24]From sea to shining sea
